<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Ablation Study on Training Phases</h3>

<figure id="S5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Ablation study results on training phases.</figcaption>
<table id="S5.T7.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
